  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya Floods Emergency Response Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project contributes to the Mombasa activities of a Caritas Kenya Programme to alleviate suffering and protect livelihoods of 10,000 vulnerable households in flood affected areas of Archdioceses of Mombasa and Kisumu, and Dioceses of Garissa and Bungoma Dioceses.

There are 3 main objectives:
&quot;	Assist the targeted communities&apos; to minimize risks and outbreaks of waterborne diseases and imsprove access to safe water.
&quot;	Reduce the mortality and morbidity of the floods affected communities
&quot;	Alleviate hunger and restoration of livelihoods for the affected communities. 

CAFOD funds will be earmarked for activities in Mombasa Archdiocese.</narrative>
  </description>
